	    "\r\n"
	    "\x1b[0;31;40mTime: 14:59  Computer command (?=help)? 6\r\n"
	    "\r\n"
	    "Log of messages sent/recieved.\r\n"
	    "None Found.\r\n"
	    "\r\n"
	    "Time: 14:59  Computer command (?=help)? ";
